  "description": "2000W Dual Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi X-Black Knight features front and rear 1000W motors with a maximum torque of 95 Nm, forming a dual-motor drive system capable of tackling 40° inclines with ease. The e-bike can reach high speeds while supporting a maximum load of 440 lbs. Riders can choose to use either a single motor or both motors depending on the terrain, with the dual-motor setup delivering enhanced power for high-speed performance on rough roads.\n\n48V 45Ah SAMSUNG Li-ion Battery\n\nThe X-Black Knight is Lankeleisi’s first e-bike to feature dual Samsung batteries: a 48V 25Ah and a 48V 20Ah, both using 21700 cells. This setup allows for ultra-long off-road rides, offering up to 140 km in full electric mode and 280 km with pedal assist. The included 48V 3A fast charger helps minimize charging time.\n\nFull Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi X-Black Knight is equipped with front fork suspension and dual 320lbs rear shocks, effectively absorbing impacts from rough terrain. This reduces discomfort for the rider and ensures a smoother, more comfortable ride over uneven surfaces.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
